                <pb facs="0521" n="409" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg409"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 24354/4.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Chargé Monroe.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-06"><hi rendition="#italic">May 6,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Express to the Costa Rican Government and to the Central American court of
                    justice the profound sympathy of the United States in the calamity at
                    Cartago.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
